Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:22:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] refactor(job-offers): give each type and props interface
 its own file

- Rename vacancies.constants.ts to job-offers.constants.ts.
- Move the query keys to job-offers-query-keys.constants.ts.
- Split job-offer.types.ts and vacancy-conditions.types.ts into one type per file.
- Move component props to types/*-props.types.ts (standard 2.7).
- Move the status and filter types out of hooks and utils.

